Comment: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It all starts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In order for my wish to be granted...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:11.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.11,0:01:19.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:29.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:35.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:42.79,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:48.47,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:53.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:59.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:05.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:12.36,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:20.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(920,920)\pos(640,560)}... The girl who wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know that this is the human world, where humans live, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whether your wish is fulfilled or not depends upon your efforts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know that too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why do you have to hang out here all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, talking like this is fun! It's so secretive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.12,0:03:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is your wish!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somewhere I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And just what do you need to do to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to fill a bottle with scarred hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get a bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you need to do to get a bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to pass a test by my actions here or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today, we're gonna check whether you have the common sense needed to make it in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The test has already begun, under my supervision and judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The criterion for the test is how well you can exhibit the basic knowledge relevant here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show me proper behavior in this springtime park!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What shall I do, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, hibernating!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you even properly enjoy yourself in the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't I even have time to take the trash out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't catch the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well, time for your next test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show me what you're going to do with that trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmmm, where should I throw out trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's crows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're after the trash. Hurry up or they'll be after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're after it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The crows are after the trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crows! Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing trying to get the crows' attention!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They looked hungry, so I thought I'd tame them by feeding them the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not even a "Kobato"! "Dobato" is good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go get a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a great teahouse right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you just trying to pick her up in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, it's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.96,0:07:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're treating? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that nice, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what did you come here for!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's treating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you just do!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, you're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, you had your boyfriend with you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit making such a big deal about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not just making a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you grin like that, people are gonna think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I'm glad it's sunny today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be busy with all the people out to see the cherry blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a cute kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take that plate for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you ask his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could do better, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you'd be more popular with the girls if you smiled a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.32,0:09:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I forgot to turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He showed up at the nursery again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, boss, something just came up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Ioryogi? There's so many people here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Probably here for the cherry blossom festival or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, that smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! Let's go take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey lady! Toss that back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.95,0:10:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No use crying over spilt milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm already shorthanded...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me help out as an apology!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Another beer on that order!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really picking this up quick. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad I could help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not unusual for Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where's my nabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but can I watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make a nabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This can be a test too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, show me your skill at making nabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you can't put those in until it boils!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put the meat in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you putting milk in!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Come on, it's healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why chocolate!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People cheer up when they eat sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No more natto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a horror show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But let's not waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss, you should try some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think we'll be adding this to the menu, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty good for her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought they'd just try a little, but they're still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think you are, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You get zero points for your knowledge of nabe back there, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it did turn out pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you 40 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.67,0:13:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He just won't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But--!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He always gets like this at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I bring him to this park a lot so as not to disturb the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He won't sleep until he's all worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.93,0:14:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His mother always used to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'd always sing to him when he cried, and calm him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:15:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, she's working hard for his sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm doing my best to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But my singing voice doesn't calm him down at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me sing for his sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.42,0:15:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I don't think I can do it as well as his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.67,0:15:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll sing my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:05.95,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The flowers which blossom in spring
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:12.68,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Are plucked in the summer sun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:19.00,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, I'm already back at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, this song...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.81,0:16:38.55,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even on days I close my windows
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:45.51,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Fluttering within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:52.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The light breaks through the clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:17:06.57,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,A faraway voice leads me on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:13.72,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Like it's smiling, like it's singing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:19.58,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The echoing sound of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:26.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least she's good at singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:32.44,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's just like Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:39.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:46.57,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Join together strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.06,0:17:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, she's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to you, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me hear it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.37,0:18:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go over there, there's a stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They brought us so many gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, no problem taking them in exchange for singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, how'd I do on the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The test, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made a total mess of the first half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How well you did with the nabe during the second half was pure luck, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess the song was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then--!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you just say the song was okay!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did too bad during the first half!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Meanie! You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried my hardest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.03,0:19:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.95,0:19:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The granny from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening, young lady who's good at singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad we've met again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks again for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to say something to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time he's enjoyed anyone's song but his mother's that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He cheered up and went right to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for not even thanking you after you sang for my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your singing really is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to hear it again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:21:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.29,0:21:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This... is a bottle, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the real thing, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. What the granny said there was worth a hundred points.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You passed the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't like it, give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I can heal scarred hearts and fill this bottle with their shards...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.41,0:22:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your wish will be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.79,0:22:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But so far you've just got the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato! What is your wish!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's somewhere that I want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you need to do to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, I must fill this bottle with scarred hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is just a warmup, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've still got a long way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you're overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you so happy about, Dobato!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato's good enough! If you don't like it, I can call you Dabada instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, fine, Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:06.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{ed}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:13.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.44,0:23:21.88,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:30.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:41.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.88,0:23:44.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.76,0:23:52.64,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you say it thankfully, if you do it thankfully
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:59.75,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Together, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:09.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.35,0:24:13.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.15,0:24:26.57,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(816,582)}... Sparkling candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.56,0:24:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(812,174)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
